          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Purrdr adds a small herdr plugin to this host. When an agent needs you, the host tells Purrdr’s server, which notifies this device. Notifications show only the workspace name — never what the agent said. Notifications from Windows hosts are best-effort." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Purrdr 會在這台主機加裝一個小型 herdr plugin。Agent 需要你時，主機會告知 Purrdr 後台，再由後台通知這支裝置。通知只顯示 Workspace 名稱，絕不包含 Agent 說的內容。Windows 主機的通知為盡力傳送，不保證送達。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Purrdr signs in to the host’s own SSH server with a key or password." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Purrdr 以金鑰或密碼登入主機本身的 SSH 服務(sshd)。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Purrdr supports macOS and Linux hosts for now." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
