          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This host has herdr %@. Purrdr needs %@ or later. Purrdr will run “herdr update --handoff” as %@@%@." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這台主機的 herdr 是 %@,Purrdr 需要 %@ 以上。Purrdr 會以 %@@%@ 執行「herdr update --handoff」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This host identifies itself with a different key. If you didn’t reinstall or reset it, stop and check it in Hosts." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這台主機用了不同的 key 表明身分。如果你沒有重新安裝或重置它，請停下來，到「主機」檢查。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This host now identifies itself with a different key. Reinstalling or resetting it does this, and so does someone intercepting the connection. If you didn’t reinstall or reset it, stop.\n\nPresented key:\n%@\n\nSaved key:\n%@" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這台主機現在用了不同的 key 表明身分。重新安裝或重置主機會這樣，有人攔截連線也會。如果你沒有重新安裝或重置它，請停下來。\n\n目前出示的 key:\n%@\n\n已儲存的 key:\n%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This host’s key hasn’t been confirmed yet. Test the connection in Hosts." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "還沒有確認這台主機的 key,請到「主機」測試連線。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This host’s password or key isn’t on this device. Edit the host and enter it again." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這支裝置上沒有這台主機的密碼或金鑰。請編輯主機並重新輸入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is a public key. Paste the private key file instead (the one without .pub)." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這是公鑰。請改貼私鑰檔(沒有 .pub 的那個)。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is the first connection to %@. It identifies itself with this key:\n\n%@\n\nTrust it only if it matches ssh-keygen -lf on that computer." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這是第一次連線到 %@。它以這個 key 表明身分:\n\n%@\n\n請在那台主機上執行 ssh-keygen -lf,確認相符才信任。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This isn’t an OpenSSH private key. Paste the whole file, starting with “-----BEGIN OPENSSH PRIVATE KEY-----”. To convert an older key, run ssh-keygen -p -f on it." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這不是 OpenSSH 私鑰。請貼上整個檔案，開頭是「-----BEGIN OPENSSH PRIVATE KEY-----」。舊格式的金鑰可以對它執行 ssh-keygen -p -f 轉換。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This key is encrypted with %@, which isn’t supported. Run ssh-keygen -p -f on the key to re-encrypt it." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這把金鑰以 %@ 加密，目前不支援。請對金鑰執行 ssh-keygen -p -f 重新加密。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This key is incomplete or damaged. Paste the whole file again." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
